    "text": "04. From 15.05.2015 the enumerator will distribute the enumeration form to the chief occupant of each household toobtain the particulars of the persons who are qualified to be registered as electors for the year 2015. The chief occupants arerequired to give the assistance to enumerator by furnishing correct information of all persons who are qualified to beregistered as electors under his household",
